      "text": "Platform to book tickets\n\nFunctional Requirements (Dump down the application requirements)\n- search nearby events (or by particular location)\n- book ticket\n- download ticket\n\n== out of scope ==\n- Admin be able to add/remove/update evens\n- Show trending/popular events\n- User be able to view bookings\n- User pay for the booking\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- Consistency > Availability for ticket booking\n- Handle scale",
